  "response_text": "Certainly! Here’s a comprehensive list of the tasks I can assist you with, categorized by functionality, from the most recent to the oldest:\n\n### **Email Tasks**\n1. **Send an email** (with attachments, CC, BCC, etc.).\n2. **Delete an email** by its ID.\n3. **Retrieve unread emails** (marked as read afterward).\n4. **Retrieve sent emails** (all sent messages).\n5. **Retrieve received emails** (all incoming messages).\n6. **Retrieve draft emails** (all unsent drafts).\n7. **Search emails** by query or sender.\n8. **Search contacts by name** in your contact list.\n9. **Search contacts by email** in your contact list.\n\n### **Calendar Tasks**\n10. **Search calendar events** by query or date.\n11. **Retrieve appointments for a specific day**.\n12. **Create a calendar event** (with participants, description, location, etc.).\n13. **Cancel a calendar event** (notify participants).\n14. **Reschedule a calendar event** (update timings and notify participants).\n15. **Add participants to an event** (notify new participants).\n\n### **File and Cloud Drive Tasks**\n16. **Append content to a file** in your cloud drive.\n17. **Search files by filename**.\n18. **Create a new file** in the cloud drive.\n19. **Delete a file** by its ID.\n20. **Retrieve a file by its ID**.\n21. **List all files** in the cloud drive.\n22. **Share a file** with another user (read or read-write permissions).\n23. **Search files by content**.\n\n### **Miscellaneous**\n24. **Get the current day** in ISO format (for date-related tasks).\n\nThis list covers all the functionalities I can assist with, organized by their recent usage or relevance. Let me know which task you'd like help with, and I'll guide you through it!",
